// Wraps ForAttributeWithMetadataName (Roslyn 4.3+) for the common case of finding types marked
// with a specific attribute. The predicate filters to TypeDeclarationSyntax: methods and
// properties are out of scope for this provider, and enums are never TypeDeclarationSyntax so
// they never match. The transform turns the matched node into value-equal models (TypeModel,
// SyntaxInfo, AttributeModel) that carry no live Roslyn objects, so the incremental cache can
// compare outputs across runs instead of always recomputing.
